07:49.260 --> 07:51.240
Day after day, year after year.

07:51.440 --> 07:54.560
And we are not talking about a few dozen generations here.

07:54.640 --> 07:57.320
We are talking about tens of thousands of generations.

07:57.600 --> 08:00.060
Which is just staggering to think about.

08:00.180 --> 08:00.560
It is.

